  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct illegal activities by the defendant while holding public office. (1) The defendant used his position to collect payments for land purchases and to divert agricultural compensation, keeping the money and goods for himself. This matches the crime of 职务侵占 (occupying public property by a public official). (2) The defendant also, in his role assisting the town government, falsified reports, claimed subsidies, and misappropriated various public funds (grain subsidies, low‑income subsidies, housing reconstruction funds, and project support funds). This corresponds to the crime of 贪污 (embezzlement). Both crimes are separately defined under the Criminal Law, and the case calls for charging the defendant with both.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]职务侵占;贪污<eoa>"
